# Open upstream fixes to watch-pr and the orch store, carried until cursor/plugins merges them.
# Each hunk is the upstream PR's own code and test, rebased onto the post-rules tree unchanged.
#
#   - #746, rollup of #664: stack discovery requests isCrossRepository and never treats a fork's
#     head as a parent or child, so a fork's open main->main PR no longer spins the parent walk
#   - #746, rollup of #666: polling sleeps, interval and query backoff alike, are capped at the
#     --timeout deadline instead of overshooting it
#   - #746, rollup of #684: a branch with a closed or merged PR plus one open replacement resolves
#     to the open one instead of failing with "multiple pull requests"
#   - #769: --status-only reports a head with no checks as ci-none in one table and stops on the
#     first query error, instead of retrying through the backoff schedule
#
# #769 and the still-open #592 both add a field after `allowDraft` in policy.ts, so if upstream
# lands #592 first this patch stops applying there and needs one line re-resolved.
#
